1. e4 c5 2. d4 cxd4 3. c3 d5 ({If black is playing for a win, then} 3... Nf6 {might be best. Either that or accept the Morra gambit}) 4. exd5 Qxd5 5. cxd4 Nc6 6. Nf3 e5 ({The alternative is} 6... Bg4 7. Be2 e6 8. Nc3 {Perlis,J-Tartakower,S/Ostend-B 1907 (3)/0-1 e.g.}) 7. Nc3 Bb4 8. Bd2 Bxc3 9. Bxc3 e4 10. Ne5 Nxe5 11. dxe5 Ne7 12. Be2 ({or} 12. Qa4+ Bd7 13. Qa3 Qe6 14. Rd1 O-O 15. Rd6 Qf5 {Kuznetsov,V-Krutyanski,A/Moscow-Leningrad m 1960 (1.29)/1/2-1/2}) 12... O-O 13. O-O Bf5 14. Qa4 Bd7 (14... Qe6 15. Rfd1 {Lammers,M (2397) -Kostic,V (2433)/31st Munich OIS A 2011 (9.4)/1-0 doesn't have a good score for black e.g.}) (14... Qc6 {Jonkman,H (2456)-Afek,Y (2344)/Leuven op 14th 2002 (6)/1/2-1/2 does better e.g.}) 15. Qa3 Qe6 16. Bc4 Qxc4 17. Qxe7 1/2-1/2

