1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nf6 5. Nxf6+ gxf6 6. c3 Bf5 7. Ne2 Nd7 8. Ng3 Bg6 9. h4 h6 $6 (9... h5 10. Be2 Qa5 11. b4 Qc7 12. Nxh5 a5 13. Nf4) (9... h5 10. Be2 Qa5 11. b4 Qc7 12. Nxh5 a5 13. Nf4 axb4 14. Nxg6 fxg6 15. Qd3 bxc3 16. Qxg6+ Kd8 17. g3 e6 18. O-O Ba3 19. Bc4 Re8 20. Re1 Qd6 21. Bf4 e5 22. dxe5 fxe5 23. Bg5+ Kc7 24. Qc2 {43 Liberzon (2455) vs Basman (2335) Beersheeva 1984 1-0 in}) 10. h5 Bh7 11. Bf4 (11. Bd3) (11. Bd3 Bxd3 12. Qxd3 Qc7 13. Qf3 e6 14. Bf4 Qa5 15. O-O Qd5 16. Qe2 Bd6 17. Bxd6 Qxd6 18. Rad1 O-O-O 19. c4 Kb8 20. Ne4 {42 Adorjan (2550) vs Huebner (2600) Candidates 1980 1-0 in}) 11... Qb6 12. Qd2 (12. Qc1 e5 13. Be3 O-O-O 14. Bc4 exd4 15. cxd4 Bb4+ 16. Kf1 Rhe8 17. Bxf7 Re7 18. Bg6 Qb5+ 19. Kg1 Bxg6 20. hxg6 Qd3 21. Rxh6 {28 Gipslis (2485) vs Bronstein (2495) Senior QP 1982 1-0 in}) 12... O-O-O 13. Be3 e5 $1 14. b4 exd4 15. Bxd4 c5 16. bxc5 Bxc5 17. Be2 Ne5 18. O-O Bxd4 19. cxd4 Qxd4 20. Qxh6 Qb6 (20... Qh4 21. Qe3 Kb8 22. Rfd1 Qg5 23. Rxd8+ Rxd8 24. Qb3 f5 25. Bf3 Rd7 26. Re1 f4 27. Ne4 Bxe4 28. Bxe4 Qxh5 29. Bxb7 Rxb7 30. Qd5 Nf3+ 31. Qxf3 Qxf3 32. gxf3) 21. Rad1 Rdg8 22. Qf4 Kb8 {Short offered DRAW as he thought White was better! Fritz rates it as 0.59 to White. Could continue 23.Rd5 Rd8 24.Rb5 Qd6 25.Rd1  Source: "Forever a 180" by Oliver Jackson (self-published) via Nigel Short. This match was reported in Vic Knox's column in the Manchester Evening News, 18 June 1983, though misreported as the English counties' final. I think it was the quarter-final (Gtr Manchester lost to Kent in the semi-final). JS} 1/2-1/2

